{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S04\",\"screen\":\"像手心捧着易碎的薄冰，想握紧，又赶紧放轻了力道\",\"source\":\"原本只是轻轻握着另一个人的手，后来不自觉地握得更紧。……想用力抱紧对方、牢牢抓住当下；但你越用力，水面的颠簸就越剧烈，船舱内的平衡就越脆弱。\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿强调不自觉地越握越紧、越用力越不安稳，屏幕稿却增加了主动放轻力道的动作，改变了原来的动作方向。\"},{\"sec\":\"S09\",\"screen\":\"像狂奔后停下抬头看夜空，心跳还快，晚风却吹干了汗\",\"source\":\"也可以想象成一个人在激动地说了很多话之后，忽然抬头看见夜空，意识到眼前的美好其实比自己的愿望大得多。\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿描写的是激动说话之后抬头看夜空，屏幕稿换成了狂奔、停下和汗被吹干，新增了不同的动作和身体经历。\"},{\"sec\":\"S12\",\"screen\":\"喉咙发紧，眼眶滚烫，嘴角高高扬着却掉下泪来\",\"source\":\"又可以是喉咙发紧、眼眶湿润，快乐到连自己想笑还是想哭都分不清。\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿保留了想笑还是想哭的模糊状态，屏幕稿却明确写成嘴角带笑并且已经掉下眼泪，把不确定的感受变成了确定的哭泣表现。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "964fcab1-0da1-4ee6-83d1-393731cdb901", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T232909559798Z", "elapsed_seconds": 123.062, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T23:31:12.639609+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "85a2e0f53d034228e5d7784b3aab7dfbac6afb638e99192c8216ca60435e6914", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T232909559798Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "7fa89f9c6fca6f95577e687a402b3a15feec60a56f7d48e121b61cdd8287c9f6"}}}
